  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Welfare Support for Cameroon&apos;s Political Prisoners</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fundraiser will provide basic humanitarian needs for thousands of mostly Southern Cameroonian prisoners of Conscience arrested from 2017 till date. They are being held by the Cameroon regime in horrendous conditions in the aftermath of protest initiated by teachers and lawyers. The crisis has now degenerated into a full blown war for basic rights of the minority English-speaking people. VRF will work in collaboration with ReleaseThem Campaign Team to identify and prioritize these needs.</narrative>
  </description>
